{"4765120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dechamel Chess", "steam_appid": 4765120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't play chess if you think it's a mess,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>you'll go up in flames lest you're Chessy Chames.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Knight might fight right,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>but come dawn on the lawn everyones a pawn.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try this new variation on chess and complete the campaign using only a limited arsenal of pieces.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compete with two additional rows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compete with one row closer to the opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compete with limited chess pieces on either side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use moats for protecting your assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >block piece movement with rocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compete with a grace period of not-attacking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3d graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >guard views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mouse, keyboard and controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >win chance bar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >turn history view</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't play chess if you think it's a mess,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>you'll go up in flames lest you're Chessy Chames.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Knight might fight right,</i></p><p class=\"bb_pa